    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 10th level, your expertise in arms crafting extends to defensive gear. As a reaction when you are hit by an attack, you can roll a d6 and add it to your AC against that attack, potentially causing it to miss. You can use this reaction a number of times equal to your Intelligence modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a short or long rest.</p>",
